5. Open question, stated plainly
--------------------------------

The makharij diagrams in section 3(b) are the only part of this repository
copied from a commercial publication rather than derived from an open dataset
or from fact. Before this repository is made public, one of the following
should happen:

    - permission is obtained from the publisher, or
    - the diagrams are redrawn from scratch, or
    - they are removed from the app.

They are noted here rather than quietly shipped, because a Quran application
that is careless about other people's rights has no standing to ask anyone to
trust its text.


